m the pause menu.Points per Rat Selector: In the Start and Replay menus, you can now adjust the points awarded per rat (from 1 to 30). The maximum target score is automatically capped by the total points available on the map.Gameplay Balancing:Rat Buffs: Increased rat stamin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T01:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163660-1843481262703443","game_id":"steam-4163660","kind":"announcement","title":"Automatic Steam Language Detection!","summary":"A quick update is live for the Gun a Rat demo!What's New:Auto Language Detection: No need to select your language manually anymore. The game now reads your Steam client settings and applies the correct language automatically when you boot up the game.Thank you all for playing, and don't forget to add Gun a Rat to your Wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T02:53:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163660-1843481262703164","game_id":"steam-4163660","kind":"announcement","title":"Shadow Fix & Menu Improvements!","summary":"A new quality-of-life patch is now live for the Gun a Rat demo!Here is what's included in this update:Fixes & Improvements:Shadow Fix: Fixed a bug that caused shadows to randomly disable during gameplay. Visuals should now be consistent and stable.Main Menu Polish: Improved interface layout for smoother and clearer navigation.Lobby Search Enhancements: Faster public game discovery and improved readability of available sessions.Thank you all for the continuous feedback! Don't forget to add Gun a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T23:24:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703164","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163660-1843481262700008","game_id":"steam-4163660","kind":"announcement","title":"Lobby List, Text Chat & Quick Match are Live!","summary":"A new patch has just been released for the Gun a Rat demo!Thanks to your feedback, we've added several major features to make the multiplayer experience much smoother, especially for solo players:Available Right Now:Lobby List (Lobby Browser): Browse the full list of open public games and pick whichever session you want to join.Lobby Text Chat: Type and chat with your teammates right inside the lobby menu to plan your strategy before starting the match.Quick Matchmaking: Automatically find and j","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T18:48:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700008","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163660-1843481262697870","game_id":"steam-4163660","kind":"update","title":"Update: Lobby Text Chat + Quick Match Live!","summary":"A new update has just been released for the Gun a Rat demo!We are continuing to improve the multiplayer experience based on your feedback. Here is what's new:What's New:Lobby Text Chat: You can now type and chat with other players directly inside the lobby menu to plan your strategy or hang out before starting the game.Quick Matchmaking: Playing solo? Use Quick Match to automatically find and join an open public game in seconds.Thank you all for playing and sharing your feedback! Let us know wha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T17:45:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163660-1843481262696188","game_id":"steam-4163660","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix: Giant Items Bug Fixed!","summary":"A quick patch has just been released for the Gun a Rat demo!What was fixed:Giant Items Bug: Some players reported that items would occasionally become insanely huge when picked up by a rat. This visual issue is now completely fixed! Items will now stay at their intended size.Thank you all for reporting bugs and sharing feedback. Keep sending your reports in the Community Hub, and don't forget to add Gun a Rat to your Wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163660-1843481262692751","game_id":"steam-4163660","kind":"announcement","title":"Gun a Rat Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"Time to gear up and clean house!The free demo for Gun a Rat is officially available right now. You can download it directly from our Steam store page (look for the \"Download Gun a Rat Demo\" button right above the purchase options).What to expect in this demo:A first taste of the gameplay and total chaos.Hunt down wild rats or mess with your friends.A sneak peek at the traps and arsenal available to you.Try it out today, let us know what you think in the Community Hub, and don't forget to add Gun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T16:22:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692751","verified_at":"2026-10-